  "description": "VOGQEP crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H147 Co5 Dy3 N2 O33,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Co1 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Co4 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Co5 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co6 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 18 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 1.656-4.340 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 46.39-126.54°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [(CoII)3(CoIII)2Dy3(μ3-OH)5(O2CtBu)12(L)2]·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 5 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies Co(II), Co(III).",
